        "note": "提交即返回；本机后台进程反复推一步，事件旁路落库、退出由该进程自行观察。本机须保持运行。"
      },
      {
        "id": "submit-cloud",
        "label": "submit × cloud",
        "focus": [
          "entry",
          "cloudFn",
          "stepOnce",
          "dispatch",
          "workerCloud",
          "tableCloud",
          "streamCloud",
          "exitWatch",
          "settle"
